# Project definition: a realistic 8-task feature build
# Format: task_id | depends_on (comma-sep or "none") | complexity (tokens) | description
#
# This models building a user authentication feature end-to-end:
# DB schema -> API -> UI components -> integration -> tests
#
# Complexity is in "token units" — a rough proxy for how much context
# an agent needs to consume + produce to complete the task.

T01|none|500|Design database schema for users table
T02|none|300|Define API contract (OpenAPI spec)
T03|T01|800|Implement database migrations
T04|T02|600|Implement auth API endpoints
T05|T03,T04|400|Wire API to database layer
T06|none|500|Build login UI component
T07|none|500|Build registration UI component
T08|T05,T06,T07|700|Integration: connect UI to API with error handling
